<slide xmlns="http://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0" id="p4-def">
  <style>
    <fill><fillColor color="rgb(247,249,250)"/></fill>
  </style>
  <data>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="40" topLeftY="60" width="8" height="110">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(13,108,112)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(13,108,112)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="66" topLeftY="60" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="caption" color="rgb(13,108,112)" bold="true">
        <p>MODULE 1 · 动态专家融合</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="96" width="820" height="56">
      <content textType="headline" color="rgb(28,58,74)" bold="true">
        <p>DEF = Dynamic Expert Fusion · 每个病例的图文权重由数据动态决定</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="64" startY="160" endX="896" endY="160">
      <border color="rgb(213,224,229)" width="2"/>
    </line>

    <!-- 左列三张竖排卡 -->
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="186" width="420" height="100" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(202,218,221)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="196" width="380" height="30">
      <content textType="body" bold="true" color="rgb(13,108,112)">
        <p>是什么：把图文各当一个“专家”</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="230" width="384" height="44">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(60,80,92)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3">
        <p>图像分支与文本分支是两个专家，不再硬性拼一块（concat）。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="298" width="420" height="100" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(202,218,221)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="298" width="6" height="100">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(13,108,112)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(13,108,112)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="82" topLeftY="308" width="360" height="30">
      <content textType="body" bold="true" color="rgb(13,108,112)">
        <p>怎么做：MoE + 路由器动态加权</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="82" topLeftY="342" width="376" height="44">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(60,80,92)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3">
        <p>路由器(router)看当前病例特征，决定图像 vs 文本各占多少权重再融合。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="410" width="420" height="76" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(240,246,242)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(190,212,198)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="418" width="380" height="28">
      <content textType="body" bold="true" color="rgb(69,122,92)">
        <p>一句话：让模型学会“这例该多看图像还是报告”</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="444" width="384" height="36">
      <content textType="caption" color="rgb(69,122,92)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3">
        <p>解法痛点1：弱化“只喂图”的旧习惯，把文本请回对话。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- 右列：加权融合流程图 -->
    <whiteboard topLeftX="520" topLeftY="196" width="400" height="300">
      <mermaid>
        <![CDATA[
          flowchart TD
            I[图像分支 Image] --> R{Router 路由器<br/>看病例定权重}
            T[文本分支 Text] --> R
            R --> W[动态加权融合]
            W --> F[单一联合表达]
            F --> L[进入聚类头部]
        ]]>
      </mermaid>
    </whiteboard>
  </data>
  <note>
    <content textType="body">
      <p>页4 · DEF：核心是『动态』二字——同一套网络，这例主要靠图像，那例主要靠报告，由路由器按当前病例动态分配，而不是把所有病例都当同一种图文配比。可反问：固定1:1加权为什么不是最优？因为病例间图文信息量不等。</p>
    </content>
  </note>
</slide>

<slide xmlns="http://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0" id="p5-leb">
  <style>
    <fill><fillColor color="rgb(247,249,250)"/></fill>
  </style>
  <data>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="40" topLeftY="60" width="8" height="110">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(88,124,160)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(88,124,160)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="66" topLeftY="60" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="caption" color="rgb(88,124,160)" bold="true">
        <p>MODULE 2 · 局部专家平衡</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="96" width="830" height="56">
      <content textType="headline" color="rgb(28,58,74)" bold="true">
        <p>LEB = Local Expert Balancing · 无标签下怎么判断“该更信哪个模态”？</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="64" startY="160" endX="896" endY="160">
      <border color="rgb(213,224,229)" width="2"/>
    </line>

    <!-- 左列：朴素加权的隐患 -->
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="178" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="body" bold="true" color="rgb(150,80,72)">
        <p>⚠ 朴素加权/平均的隐患</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="216" width="420" height="130" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(253,242,240)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(231,199,194)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="230" width="382" height="104" color="rgb(60,80,92)">
      <content textType="body" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p>做完 DEF 后若只把图/文简单平均或全局一个权重，会掩盖“占比小但对这一簇内的病例才关键”的单模态信号——融合把少数派优势稀释了。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="360" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="body" bold="true" color="rgb(150,80,72)">
        <p>关键词</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="396" width="420" height="86" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(252,232,228)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(231,199,194)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="408" width="384" height="64">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(120,60,52)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35">
        <p>全局平均 → 让“局部”优势被抹平<br/>被吞的单模态 = 本可救回的信息</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- 右列：LEB 机制 -->
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="178" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="body" bold="true" color="rgb(13,108,112)">
        <p>✓ LEB：按局部可靠度再平衡</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="216" width="388" height="130" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(240,247,247)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(202,224,224)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="540" topLeftY="230" width="352" height="104" color="rgb(60,80,92)">
      <content textType="body" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p>无标签环境下，用「邻居内聚度 + 邻居熵」评估每个模态在局部邻域的可靠度；对更可靠的那个模态加重，防止融合吞掉它。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="360" width="388" height="122" rx="6">
